-- the covering hypothesis H_cov: every true conformation of the chain restricts, on every segment, to
-- one the record holds. It is a property of the record, checkable on it, and not a law of physics: a
-- segment's conformation depends on its context.
HCov : (C : Type 0) → FoldProblem C → Cover C → Type 0
HCov C F K = (b : fp-basin C F) → (x : C) → fp-in C F b x → Glued C K x
